       <div data-eb-slot="awsm-5da967e5-19f8-4e47-8265-19ea46b30bf3" data-eb-slot-meta="{'version':'1.0','slotId':'awsm-5da967e5-19f8-4e47-8265-19ea46b30bf3','slotName':'awsm-sname-737f5744-80e8-4c2c-9ab3-b399cb26fcc8','experienceId':'bd7a3c6e-9948-11ee-b9d1-0242ac120002','allowBlank':false,'hasAltExp':false,'isRTR':false,'dataKey':'null','filters':{'limit':1}}" data-eb-slot-visited="true">
        <div data-eb-tpl-n="awsm-rt/rt-text-media-tabs" data-eb-tpl-v="1.0.0" data-eb-ce="" data-eb-c-scope="5da967e5-19f8-4e47-8265-19ea46b30bf3" data-eb-d-scope="INLINE" data-eb-locale="en-US" data-eb-369baad2="" data-eb-ssr-ce="" data-eb-tpl-ns="awsmRT" data-eb-hydrated="done">
         <script type="application/json">{"data":{"items":[{"fields":{"itemLongLoc":"<p>Your day moves fast. A new service launches, and you’re immediately hands-on with it. You join a debate and solve the architecture problem you’ve been wrestling with for weeks. You sit down with the engineers who built the services you rely on and walk away with the answers you need to move forward.\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>LAUNCH SESSIONS</b>\n <br>\n Hands-on with new services the same day they're announced&nbsp;\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>BUILDERS’ SESSIONS</b>\n <br>\n One problem, 15 practitioners, candid discussion of what worked and what didn't\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>ASK THE EXPERTS</b>\n <br>\n Direct access to the experts who build, develop, and deploy these services daily— bring your hardest questions&nbsp;\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>500-LEVEL DEEP DIVES</b>\n <br>\n Go deeper than the documentation by digging into the science and cutting-edge research behind the technology&nbsp;\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>INDUSTRY MEETUPS</b>\n <br>\n Peers from different industries who solved your challenges a different way&nbsp;\n <br>\n <b>\n  <br> BETWEEN SESSIONS\n  <br> \n </b>Drop into the Expo, catch a live demo you didn't plan on, grab a coffee in a community hub&nbsp;</p>","itemMediaAltText":"Missing alt text value","itemOption":"right","itemMediaURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/IMG_builders.7ad4c14ef62cad53029bbafad2e96dd7c5e32181.png","id":"ams#c1","itemHeading":"For those who build and implement ","itemTextLoc3":"For those who build and implement ","itemBoolean":"true"},"metadata":{"tags":[]}},{"fields":{"itemLongLoc":"<p>Your day is structured around your most pressing decisions. Customer stories show you real outcomes and real tradeoffs from your industry. Working sessions let you pressure-test your strategy. You leave each day with evidence, connections, and clarity you can bring back to your team.\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>CUSTOMER STORIES</b>\n <br>\n Real decisions from your industry — what worked, what didn't, why they pivoted&nbsp;\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>CONNECTED LEARNING JOURNEYS</b>\n <br>\n A curated path for your role — no assembling a schedule from over 2,200 sessions&nbsp;\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>INTERACTIVE WORKING SESSIONS</b>\n <br>\n Pressure-test your cloud strategy&nbsp;\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>DEMOS</b>\n <br>\n Before-and-after business impact — concrete evidence for stakeholders&nbsp;\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>EXECUTIVE MEETUPS\n  <br> </b>From startup founders to enterprise executives, connect with peers who are navigating the same transformation decisions as you.\n <br>\n <br>\n <b>BETWEEN SESSIONS\n  <br> </b>A coffee, a live demo you didn't plan on, meeting with a partner who's deployed what you're evaluating&nbsp;\n <br></p>","itemMediaAltText":"Missing alt text value","itemOption":"right","itemMediaURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/IMG_leaders.eb8874f0413fe40724fe507ebcbff96da734b5bc.png","id":"ams#c2","itemHeading":"For those who lead and strategize ","itemTextLoc3":"For those who lead and strategize ","itemBoolean":"true"},"metadata":{"tags":[]}},{"fields":{"patternHeading":"A day at re:Invent","patternBoolean2":"true","id":"ams#text-media-collectionc3#pattern-data","patternColumns":"3","patternSubheading":" Five days, 2,200+ sessions, and countless opportunities to build your network.  Here's what a single day looks like."},"metadata":{"tags":[{"name":"pattern-data","description":"Default pattern data","id":"ams#text-media-collectionc3#pattern-data","namespaceId":"text-media-collection"}]}}]},"metadata":{"auth":{},"testAttributes":{}},"context":{"page":{"pageUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/"},"contentType":"page","environment":{"stage":"prod","region":"us-west-2"},"sdkVersion":"2.0.27"},"refMap":{"manifest.js":"6a107764b4","rt-text-media-tabs.js":"5a447f3e53","rt-text-media-tabs.css":"873933b69c","rt-text-media-tabs.rtl.css":"8e3f38f517","rt-text-media-tabs.css.js":"69ced0cc5b","rt-text-media-tabs.rtl.css.js":"4dc0806d8f"},"settings":{"templateMappings":{"tabLabel":"itemTextLoc3","patternHeading":"patternHeading","patternSubheading":"patternSubheading","patternTheme":"patternTextNoLoc","patternDark":"patternBoolean2","hyperlinkText":"itemCTALabel","hyperlinkUrl":"itemCTAURL","heading":"itemHeading","dark":"itemBoolean","mediaAltText":"itemMediaAltText","mediaPosition":"itemOption","mediaUrl":"itemMediaURL","body":"itemLongLoc","videoThumbnailUrl":"itemMediaURL2","videoOverlayTitle":"itemMediaAltText2","videoPlayButtonText":"itemTextLoc2"}}}</script>
         <div data-eb-tpl-root="" data-reactroot=""><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","name":"A day at re:Invent","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/IMG_builders.7ad4c14ef62cad53029bbafad2e96dd7c5e32181.png","name":"For those who build and implement ","description":"Missing alt text value"},"position":1},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/IMG_leaders.eb8874f0413fe40724fe507ebcbff96da734b5bc.png","name":"For those who lead and strategize ","description":"Missing alt text value"},"position":2}]}</script><div><div data-rg-lang="en" data-rg-locale="en-US" lang="en-US" dir="ltr"><div data-rg-theme="fuchsia" data-rg-mode="dark" data-rg-style-count="0"><div id="a-day-at-reinvent" class="rgta_70747978 rgta_ddb4146d" data-rg-n="JumpLinkContainer"><div data-rg-n="GridStack" class="rgta_92ef7532" style="--rg-gridstack-gap:var(--rg-margin-2)"><div class="rgta_12ed26d7 rgta_85859631 rgta_f56407eb" data-rg-n="Grid" style="--rg-grid-gap:var(--rg-margin-3)"><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_f6ca794c"><div class="rgta_21f15a5f" data-rg-n="TemplateHeader"><div class="rgta_12ed26d7 rgta_85859631" data-rg-n="Grid" style="--rg-grid-gap:var(--rg-margin-3)"><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_2f390d15 rgta_b17ba09f rgta_67470d0b rgta_f962cbf7 rgta_f72cb091 rgta_62f5ad9c"><h2 data-rg-n="HeadingText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_5d220f64 rgta_26b3f3ee">A day at re:Invent</h2><p data-rg-n="SubheadingText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_1671485e rgta_ca618660"> Five days, 2,200+ sessions, and countless opportunities to build your network.  Here's what a single day looks like.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rgta_12ed26d7 rgta_85859631 rgta_f56407eb" data-rg-n="Grid" style="--rg-grid-gap:var(--rg-margin-3)"><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_f6ca794c"><div class="rgta_12ed26d7 rgta_61bce5cf rgta_85859631" data-rg-n="Tabs" style="--panel-width: 1024.666748046875px; --scroller-offset: 0; --scrollbar-width: 0px; --rg-grid-gap: var(--rg-margin-3);"><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_f6ca794c rgta_51f1d973"><div class="rgta_0a41c7d6"><div class="rgta_19a55ae8"><div data-rg-theme="fuchsia" data-rg-mode="dark" data-rg-style-count="0"><div class="rgta_7d8ac83e" data-rg-n="TabList"><div role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" style="--tab-indicator-x: 323.22918701171875px; --tab-indicator-width: 300.3125px;" class="rgta_5badf975 rgta_e2369703 rgta_5ee17e89 rgta_6e7306c5" data-rg-n="BackgroundGradient"></div><div class="rgta_ddd70947" role="tablist"><div class="rgta_8240d23b" role="presentation"><button role="tab" tabindex="-1" data-rg-n="Tab" aria-selected="false" id="tab-_0_-ams#c1" aria-controls="tabpanel-_0_-ams#c1" type="button" data-rigel-analytics="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Tab&quot;,&quot;properties&quot;:{&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;tertiary&quot;,&quot;positionIndex&quot;:0}}" class="rgta_9e423fbb rgta_1ed8cbde rgta_5962fadc rgta_e90ac70d rgta_3ef5a62a rgta_38d8ffac rgta_f7822e54 rgta_090951dc rgta_b78e9379 rgta_934373fe"><span data-rg-n="UtilityText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_5e58a6df rgta_82d7eac3 rgta_f5857abf rgta_aa83ac72">For those who build and implement </span></button></div><div class="rgta_8240d23b" role="presentation"><button role="tab" tabindex="0" data-rg-n="Tab" aria-selected="true" id="tab-_0_-ams#c2" aria-controls="tabpanel-_0_-ams#c2" type="button" data-rigel-analytics="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Tab&quot;,&quot;properties&quot;:{&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;tertiary&quot;,&quot;positionIndex&quot;:1}}" class="rgta_9e423fbb rgta_1ed8cbde rgta_5962fadc rgta_e90ac70d rgta_3ef5a62a rgta_38d8ffac rgta_f7822e54 rgta_090951dc rgta_b78e9379 rgta_934373fe"><span data-rg-n="UtilityText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_5e58a6df rgta_82d7eac3 rgta_f5857abf rgta_aa83ac72">For those who lead and strategize </span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_f6ca794c rgta_f50a89f5"><div class="rgta_3a416027"><div class="rgta_26fa8865 rgta_670cb5fa" role="tabpanel" id="tabpanel-_0_-ams#c1" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="tab-_0_-ams#c1" data-rg-n="TabPanel" inert=""><div class="rgta_12ed26d7 rgta_0f24bbc2 rgta_85859631 rgta_f51223df" data-rg-n="TextMediaContent" data-eb-item-id="ams#c1" data-rg-media-position="end" style="--rg-grid-gap:var(--rg-margin-3)"><div data-rg-n="Col" data-rg-text-form="long" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_2f390d15 rgta_2aef2225 rgta_387166a7 rgta_1cdd9d8d rgta_a80e4900 rgta_f36c46cb rgta_b3cb8c45"><h3 data-rg-n="HeadingText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_5d220f64 rgta_45192e83 rgta_4c76e63e">For those who build and implement </h3><div data-rg-n="BodyText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_98b54368 rgta_007aef8b">
                        <p>Your day moves fast. A new service launches, and you’re immediately hands-on with it. You join a debate and solve the architecture problem you’ve been wrestling with for weeks. You sit down with the engineers who built the services you rely on and walk away with the answers you need to move forward. <br><br><b>LAUNCH SESSIONS</b> <br>
                          Hands-on with new services the same day they're announced&nbsp; <br><br><b>BUILDERS’ SESSIONS</b> <br>
                          One problem, 15 practitioners, candid discussion of what worked and what didn't <br><br><b>ASK THE EXPERTS</b> <br>
                          Direct access to the experts who build, develop, and deploy these services daily— bring your hardest questions&nbsp; <br><br><b>500-LEVEL DEEP DIVES</b> <br>
                          Go deeper than the documentation by digging into the science and cutting-edge research behind the technology&nbsp; <br><br><b>INDUSTRY MEETUPS</b> <br>
                          Peers from different industries who solved your challenges a different way&nbsp; <br><b> <br>
                           BETWEEN SESSIONS <br></b>Drop into the Expo, catch a live demo you didn't plan on, grab a coffee in a community hub&nbsp;</p>
                       </div></div><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_710fa332 rgta_3f136014"></div><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_2f390d15 rgta_2aef2225 rgta_3a5c8655 rgta_284304a7 rgta_96bcfc07 rgta_f9cd03b5 rgta_dd9f9871"><img class="rgta_8e9ae6ea rgta_1d5b06fc" src="./video-poster_files/IMG_builders.7ad4c14ef62cad53029bbafad2e96dd7c5e32181.png" alt="Missing alt text value" loading="lazy" data-rg-n="Image" fetchpriority="low"></div></div></div><div class="rgta_26fa8865 rgta_05264edb" role="tabpanel" id="tabpanel-_0_-ams#c2" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="tab-_0_-ams#c2" data-rg-n="TabPanel"><div class="rgta_12ed26d7 rgta_0f24bbc2 rgta_85859631 rgta_f51223df" data-rg-n="TextMediaContent" data-eb-item-id="ams#c2" data-rg-media-position="end" style="--rg-grid-gap:var(--rg-margin-3)"><div data-rg-n="Col" data-rg-text-form="long" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_2f390d15 rgta_2aef2225 rgta_387166a7 rgta_1cdd9d8d rgta_a80e4900 rgta_f36c46cb rgta_b3cb8c45"><h3 data-rg-n="HeadingText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_5d220f64 rgta_45192e83 rgta_4c76e63e">For those who lead and strategize </h3><div data-rg-n="BodyText" class="rgta_8711ccd9 rgta_98b54368 rgta_007aef8b">
                        <p>Your day is structured around your most pressing decisions. Customer stories show you real outcomes and real tradeoffs from your industry. Working sessions let you pressure-test your strategy. You leave each day with evidence, connections, and clarity you can bring back to your team. <br><br><b>CUSTOMER STORIES</b> <br>
                          Real decisions from your industry — what worked, what didn't, why they pivoted&nbsp; <br><br><b>CONNECTED LEARNING JOURNEYS</b> <br>
                          A curated path for your role — no assembling a schedule from over 2,200 sessions&nbsp; <br><br><b>INTERACTIVE WORKING SESSIONS</b> <br>
                          Pressure-test your cloud strategy&nbsp; <br><br><b>DEMOS</b> <br>
                          Before-and-after business impact — concrete evidence for stakeholders&nbsp; <br><br><b>EXECUTIVE MEETUPS <br></b>From startup founders to enterprise executives, connect with peers who are navigating the same transformation decisions as you. <br><br><b>BETWEEN SESSIONS <br></b>A coffee, a live demo you didn't plan on, meeting with a partner who's deployed what you're evaluating&nbsp; <br></p>
                       </div></div><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_710fa332 rgta_3f136014"></div><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgta_7ca45506 rgta_2f390d15 rgta_2aef2225 rgta_3a5c8655 rgta_284304a7 rgta_96bcfc07 rgta_f9cd03b5 rgta_dd9f9871"><img class="rgta_8e9ae6ea rgta_1d5b06fc" src="./video-poster_files/IMG_leaders.eb8874f0413fe40724fe507ebcbff96da734b5bc.png" alt="Missing alt text value" loading="lazy" data-rg-n="Image"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
       </div>
      </div>
