         <div data-eb-tpl-root="" data-reactroot=""><div><div data-rg-lang="en" data-rg-locale="en-US" lang="en-US" dir="ltr"><div data-rg-theme="indigo" data-rg-mode="dark" data-rg-style-count="0"><div id="ready-to-make-the-case" class="rgtx_70747978 rgtx_ddb4146d" data-rg-n="JumpLinkContainer"><div class="rgtx_12ed26d7 rgtx_85859631 rgtx_f56407eb" data-rg-n="Grid" style="--rg-grid-gap:var(--rg-margin-3)"><div data-rg-n="Col" class="rgtx_7ca45506 rgtx_2f390d15 rgtx_2aef2225 rgtx_67470d0b rgtx_f962cbf7 rgtx_f72cb091 rgtx_62f5ad9c"><div class="rgtx_79e36098 rgtx_5d80d8cb" data-rg-n="SpaceBetween" data-rg-gap-size="3"><h2 data-rg-n="HeadingText" class="rgtx_8711ccd9 rgtx_5d220f64 short-form-heading rgtx_26b3f3ee">Ready to make the case? </h2><div class="rgtx_79e36098 rgtx_5d80d8cb rgtx_69ec9f91" data-rg-n="SpaceBetween" data-rg-gap-size="3"><h5 data-rg-n="SubheadingText" class="rgtx_8711ccd9 rgtx_1671485e rgtx_ca618660"></h5><a data-rg-n="Button" href="https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/approval-toolkit/?trk=d82d4925-fa22-43c7-9105-ffbf6715ff6b&amp;sc_channel=ps" class="rgtx_9e423fbb rgtx_1ed8cbde rgtx_5962fadc rgtx_e90ac70d rgtx_38d8ffac rgtx_f7822e54 rgtx_303c672b rgtx_b78e9379" role="button" data-rigel-analytics="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;properties&quot;:{&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;primary&quot;}}" style="text-decoration:none"><span data-rg-n="UtilityText" class="rgtx_8711ccd9 rgtx_5e58a6df rgtx_82d7eac3 rgtx_f5857abf rgtx_aa83ac72">View re:Invent Approval Toolkit</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
