       <div data-eb-slot="awsm-253ae059-c41a-4469-9e50-f76b346529dd" data-eb-slot-meta="{'version':'1.0','slotId':'awsm-253ae059-c41a-4469-9e50-f76b346529dd','slotName':'awsm-sname-f7f3c686-ee4e-4bba-82db-0a4c1107cdcd','experienceId':'4b9a3631-6158-4cd5-a22d-ac29a65f7846','allowBlank':false,'hasAltExp':false,'isRTR':false,'dataKey':'null','filters':{'limit':1}}" data-eb-slot-visited="true">
        <div data-eb-tpl-n="awsm-rt/compass-lite" data-eb-tpl-v="1.0.0" data-eb-ce="" data-eb-c-scope="253ae059-c41a-4469-9e50-f76b346529dd" data-eb-d-scope="INLINE" data-eb-locale="en-US" data-eb-d3172578="" data-eb-ssr-ce="" data-eb-tpl-ns="awsmRT" data-eb-hydrated="done">
         <script type="application/json">{"data":{"items":[{"fields":{"itemTextLoc":"experts","id":"compassLite#getting-hands-on","itemHeading":"Getting hands-on","awtJSON":"{\"cards\": [{\"id\": \"howto-title\", \"title\": \"Deploy, test, and build\", \"body\": \"Workshops and builders' sessions where you can work alongside AWS experts in live environments. Walk out with working code and solutions you can bring back.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://registration.awsevents.com/flow/awsevents/reinvent2026/eventcatalog/page/eventcatalog\", \"ctaLabel\": \"Browse sessions\", \"badge\": \"Event catalog\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-networking-img2.90597f8329715a4398c53231140eb2cc3d817f51.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Example card image\"}, {\"id\": \"howto-length\", \"title\": \"Ask the experts\", \"body\": \"Small group conversations designed to get you answers. Find chalk talks and code talks where you ask questions and discuss architecture with AWS engineers.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://registration.awsevents.com/flow/awsevents/reinvent2026/eventcatalog/page/eventcatalog\", \"ctaLabel\": \"Browse sessions\", \"badge\": \"Event catalog\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-hearing-from-experts-img2.5e320466bc834d711052dc4debab065a2612ccd5.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Example card image\"}]}"},"metadata":{"tags":[]}},{"fields":{"itemTextLoc":"hear","id":"compassLite#experts","itemHeading":"Hearing from experts","awtJSON":"{\"cards\": [{\"id\": \"howto-title\", \"title\": \"Keynote and customer stories\", \"body\": \"See what's next in the cloud and AI firsthand. Talk to the teams who built it before the week is over.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/sessions/keynotes\", \"ctaLabel\": \"Learn more\", \"badge\": \"Keynotes\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-learnfromexperts-keynotes1.36949f2ef54d12dd43adcb9cafbce2b523f612ab.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Example card image\"}, {\"id\": \"howto-length\", \"title\": \"Industry trends and topics\", \"body\": \"See the speakers presenting on today's challenges, industry-leading solutions, and the customer stories behind them.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/sessions/speakers/\", \"ctaLabel\": \"View 2026 featured speakers\", \"badge\": \"Featured Speakers\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-learnfromexperts-keynotes3.ab6f82841e73e192d50f915f17491d38d8f5c5df.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Example card image\"}]}"},"metadata":{"tags":[]}},{"fields":{"itemTextLoc":"learning","id":"compassLite#my-learning","itemHeading":"My learning experience","awtJSON":"{\"cards\": [{\"id\": \"csv-one-row\", \"title\": \"Start exploring sessions\", \"body\": \"The first 200 sessions are now live. Browse by topic, level, and format to find what fits your week. More sessions coming soon.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://registration.awsevents.com/flow/awsevents/reinvent2026/eventcatalog/page/eventcatalog/\", \"ctaLabel\": \"Browse the event catalog\", \"badge\": \"Learn\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-hands-on-learning-img1.591e796b088eb63c9aa8b829c466513e3da61f6f.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Example card image\"}, {\"id\": \"howto-length\", \"title\": \"Build your skills at every level \", \"body\": \"From foundational to expert — see how breakouts, workshops, chalk talks, and more are designed to match your experience and learning style.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/sessions/how-youll-learn/\", \"ctaLabel\": \"Learn more\", \"badge\": \"Learn\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-hands-on-learning-img2.78557b9f9aff21f9e27d6f9b0145710037e8c09b.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Example card image\"}]}"},"metadata":{"tags":[]}},{"fields":{"itemTextLoc":"plan-trip","id":"compassLite#howto-design","itemHeading":"Planning my trip","awtJSON":"{\"cards\": [{\"id\": \"design-alt2\", \"title\": \"Save with bulk purchase price\", \"body\": \"Bring your team and save an additional 10% when you purchase 10 passes or more in a single transaction.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/pricing\", \"ctaLabel\": \"See pricing and register\", \"badge\": \"Plan\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-planyourtrip-img2.0890ab08547776008872ff636efb8a838c7695a9.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Accessibility tip image\"}, {\"id\": \"design-cta\", \"title\": \"re:Invent venues and hotels \", \"body\": \"Register and book your hotel to lock in a discounted rate. Stay where sessions happen, or choose a nearby hotel. Discount rates available for both.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://registration.awsevents.com/flow/awsevents/reinvent2026/venueshotel/page/venuehotel\", \"ctaLabel\": \"See hotels and venues \", \"badge\": \"Plan\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-planyourtrip-venueandhotel.dc3c3cc9f82875fcb2aa44e1e29885e7f40079d4.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"CTA best practices image\"}]}"},"metadata":{"tags":[]}},{"fields":{"itemTextLoc":"network-opportunities","id":"compassLite#howto-network-opportunities","itemHeading":"Networking opportunities","awtJSON":"{\"cards\": [{\"id\": \"design-alt\", \"title\": \"Beyond the sessions\", \"body\": \"Game nights, hackathons, networking receptions, and a few surprises. Something's always happening between or after sessions. \", \"ctaLink\": \"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/experiences/uniquely-reinvent/\", \"ctaLabel\": \"Learn more\", \"badge\": \"Networking\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/COMPASS-networking-img1.032683e6b3d1700f84a30f0fd7659749187be316.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"Accessibility tip image\"}, {\"id\": \"design-cta\", \"title\": \"Explore at the Expo\", \"body\": \"Opening Monday with the welcome reception. Stop by throughout the week to connect with cloud innovators, explore solutions in live demos, and see what's new.\", \"ctaLink\": \"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/experiences/expo/\", \"ctaLabel\": \"Learn more\", \"badge\": \"Networking\", \"variant\": \"horizontal\", \"mediaType\": \"image\", \"mediaSrc\": \"https://d1.awsstatic.com/onedam/marketing-channels/website/aws/en_US/events/approved/reinvent26/home/compass-expo.9e1ef148529d443d9c76652eed502d454070c684.png\", \"mediaAlt\": \"CTA best practices image\"}]}"},"metadata":{"tags":[]}},{"fields":{"itemTextLoc2":"I'm interested in","patternBoolean2":"1","id":"compass-lite-pattern-data"},"metadata":{"tags":[{"id":"compass-lite#compass-lite#pattern-data"}]}}]},"metadata":{"auth":{},"testAttributes":{}},"context":{"page":{"pageUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/events/reinvent/"},"contentType":"page","environment":{"stage":"prod","region":"us-west-2"},"sdkVersion":"2.0.27"},"refMap":{"compass-lite.rtl.css":"0c357f7188","compass-lite.js":"2b45621955","compass-lite.css":"90b19a56f1","compass-lite.css.js":"044d933b1d","compass-lite.rtl.css.js":"1349e61828","manifest.js":"03dd961190"},"settings":{"templateMappings":{"patternPersonalizationText":"itemTextLoc2","patternDark":"patternBoolean2","label":"itemHeading","value":"itemTextLoc","interactiveCards":"awtJSON"}}}</script>
